(i)  EUR 50,000 (fifty thousand euros) to each of the applicants, all heads of damage taken together;

(ii)  for costs and expenses, EUR 10,500 (ten thousand five hundred euros) to Selim Sadak, Leyla Zana, Hatip Dicle, Orhan Doğan, Ahmet Türk, Sırrı Sakık and Sedat Yurttaş together and EUR 9,000 (nine thousand euros) to Nizamettin Toguç, Naif Güneş, Mahmut Kılınç, Zübeyir Aydar, Ali Yiğit and Remzi Kartal together;

(b)  that simple interest at an annual rate of 7.25%  shall be payable from the expiry of the above-mentioned three months until settlement;

